# Cloudflare Pages custom headers
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/headers/
#
# RFC 8288 Link headers point agents at this site's machine-readable entry
# points without them having to parse the SPA's HTML first. Pages joins
# repeated header names with a comma, which is exactly RFC 8288's list form.
#
# Only IANA-registered relation types are used:
#   canonical    RFC 6596
#   describedby  https://www.w3.org/TR/powder-dr/#assoc-linking
#   service-doc  RFC 8631
#   license      RFC 4946
#
# There is no api-catalog / service-desc entry because FSS is a CLI, not a
# hosted API — advertising one would point agents at nothing.

/
  Link: <https://fss.coody.app/>; rel="canonical"
  Link: </llms.txt>; rel="describedby"; type="text/plain"
  Link: <https://github.com/coodyapp/fss>; rel="service-doc"; type="text/html"
  Link: <https://github.com/coodyapp/fss/blob/main/LICENSE>; rel="license"

/index.html
  Link: <https://fss.coody.app/>; rel="canonical"
  Link: </llms.txt>; rel="describedby"; type="text/plain"
  Link: <https://github.com/coodyapp/fss>; rel="service-doc"; type="text/html"
  Link: <https://github.com/coodyapp/fss/blob/main/LICENSE>; rel="license"
